      "body": "Fixes #1335.\n\nWith the delayed FP8 recipe, TP=1 and PP>=3, `patch_grad_zero_and_data_prefetch` wraps `data_iterator` in a `CudaPrefetchIterator` on every rank. Middle pipeline stages build no dataset and receive `data_iterator=None`, so the prefetcher's first `next(None)` raises `TypeError: 'NoneType' object is not an iterator` at iteration 1.\n\nThis change skips the prefetcher when `data_iterator is None`. `_pf` stays `None`, so `_synced_prefetch_fwd_bwd` passes the original `None` through unchanged, the same way the VPP list case already works. The first and last stages are unaffected.\n\nI found this on v26.8 (TP=1, PP=8, DP=4, 32 x MI355X, `--fp8_recipe delayed`), where middle-stage ranks crashed at iteration 1. The same code is on `main`.\n",
      "changedFiles": 2,
      "comments": {
        "nodes": [],
        "pageInfo": {
          "endCursor": null,
          "hasNextPage": false
        },
        "totalCount": 0
      },
